{"id":"bc7d5064491f1d37","group":"20","path":"20/20-thm-1gen-low.md","title":"1-generic 的 GL1 性质及条件低性","display":"thm-1gen-low — 1-generic 的 GL1 性质及条件低性","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-thm-1gen-low","aliases":["20-thm-1gen-low"],"display":"thm-1gen-low — 1-generic 的 GL1 性质及条件低性","chapter":"6","section":"6.3.4","source_kind":"book-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_reference":"Exercise 6.3.4","source_pdf_pages":[172],"source_printed_pages":[138],"depends_on":["[[20-df-1gen]]","[[20-df-gl1]]","[[20-df-low-high]]","[[20-df-functional-graph]]","[[20-df-join]]","[[20-thm-K-one-complete]]","[[20-thm-jump]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-thm-1gen-low"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-thm-1gen-low</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-1gen-low — 1-generic 的 GL1 性质及条件低性"},{"key":"chapter","html":"6"},{"key":"section","html":"6.3.4"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Exercise 6.3.4"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>172</span></div>"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>138</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b03a71cd282632fa\" href=\"?note=b03a71cd282632fa\" title=\"20-df-1gen\">20-df-1gen</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"c4781c7288e610af\" href=\"?note=c4781c7288e610af\" title=\"20-df-gl1\">20-df-gl1</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"91065cedbdf2fc27\" href=\"?note=91065cedbdf2fc27\" title=\"20-df-low-high\">20-df-low-high</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"634b02102672cc2a\" href=\"?note=634b02102672cc2a\" title=\"20-df-functional-graph\">20-df-functional-graph</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"08b4fd5163a7f955\" href=\"?note=08b4fd5163a7f955\" title=\"20-df-join\">20-df-join</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"de54fb8c1326b2f0\" href=\"?note=de54fb8c1326b2f0\" title=\"20-thm-K-one-complete\">20-thm-K-one-complete</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"2ea8548c98f572c3\" href=\"?note=2ea8548c98f572c3\" title=\"20-thm-jump\">20-thm-jump</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{1Generic}(G)\">\\(\\operatorname{1Generic}(G)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\\in2^\\omega\">\\(G\\in2^\\omega\\)</span> 与其特征集合识别，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{GL}_1\">\\(\\operatorname{GL}_1\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Low}_1\">\\(\\operatorname{Low}_1\\)</span> 及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\oplus\">\\(\\oplus\\)</span> 采用所引定义。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"b03a71cd282632fa\" href=\"?note=b03a71cd282632fa\" title=\"20-df-1gen\">20-df-1gen</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"c4781c7288e610af\" href=\"?note=c4781c7288e610af\" title=\"20-df-gl1\">20-df-gl1</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"91065cedbdf2fc27\" href=\"?note=91065cedbdf2fc27\" title=\"20-df-low-high\">20-df-low-high</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"634b02102672cc2a\" href=\"?note=634b02102672cc2a\" title=\"20-df-functional-graph\">20-df-functional-graph</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"08b4fd5163a7f955\" href=\"?note=08b4fd5163a7f955\" title=\"20-df-join\">20-df-join</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"de54fb8c1326b2f0\" href=\"?note=de54fb8c1326b2f0\" title=\"20-thm-K-one-complete\">20-thm-K-one-complete</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-14\" data-note=\"2ea8548c98f572c3\" href=\"?note=2ea8548c98f572c3\" title=\"20-thm-jump\">20-thm-jump</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}1gen\\text{-}low}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{GL}_1(G),\\qquad\nG\\le_T\\varnothing&#39;\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{Low}_1(G).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}1gen\\text{-}low}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{GL}_1(G),\\qquad\nG\\le_T\\varnothing&#39;\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{Low}_1(G).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e\">\\(e\\)</span>，令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V_e=\\{\\sigma:\\Phi_e^\\sigma(e)\\downarrow\\}\">\\(V_e=\\{\\sigma:\\Phi_e^\\sigma(e)\\downarrow\\}\\)</span>，这是统一 c.e. 串集合。由 1-generic 性，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span> 或有一个前缀在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V_e\">\\(V_e\\)</span>，或有一个前缀 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\">\\(\\tau\\)</span>，其任何延长均不在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V_e\">\\(V_e\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\\oplus K\">\\(G\\oplus K\\)</span> 决定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e\\in G&#39;\">\\(e\\in G&#39;\\)</span>。依次取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma_n=G\\upharpoonright n\">\\(\\sigma_n=G\\upharpoonright n\\)</span>；先用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 步有界模拟检查 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi_e^{\\sigma_n}(e)\">\\(\\Phi_e^{\\sigma_n}(e)\\)</span> 是否已停止，若是返回 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1\">\\(1\\)</span>。否则用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\">\\(K\\)</span> 判定是否存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho\\succeq\\sigma_n\">\\(\\rho\\succeq\\sigma_n\\)</span> 属于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V_e\">\\(V_e\\)</span>，若不存在返回 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span>；存在就增加 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span>。若真实计算停止，其有限时间与 use 在某个足够大 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 下被看到，不会被错误地返回 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span>。若不停止，generic 只能给避开前缀，在其长度以后的某个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 第二个检查返回 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span>。因此算法全停止且正确，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G&#39;\\le_TG\\oplus K\">\\(G&#39;\\le_TG\\oplus K\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>一般跳跃定理给 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\\le_TG&#39;\">\\(G\\le_TG&#39;\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\\le_TG&#39;\">\\(K\\le_TG&#39;\\)</span>，把两方向 oracle 查询按偶奇位并接，得 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\\oplus K\\le_TG&#39;\">\\(G\\oplus K\\le_TG&#39;\\)</span>。以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\\equiv_T\\varnothing&#39;\">\\(K\\equiv_T\\varnothing&#39;\\)</span> 互译，即 GL1。若另外 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\\le_T\\varnothing&#39;\">\\(G\\le_T\\varnothing&#39;\\)</span>，join 等价于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varnothing&#39;\">\\(\\varnothing&#39;\\)</span>，才得到低性；结论没有把任意 1-generic 都说成低集合。</p>\n<p>来源：印刷 138 / PDF 172。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-1gen","status":"resolved","id":"b03a71cd282632fa","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-1gen]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-gl1","status":"resolved","id":"c4781c7288e610af","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-gl1]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-low-high","status":